{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50985","headline":"赠马道士 · 李九龄","name":"赠马道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水共逍遥云共孤，混时言笑只佯愚。\n经年但醉宜城酒，千里唯担《华岳图》。\n寻野鹤来空碧洞，覔琴僧去渡重湖。\n人间再见知何日，乞取先生石辘轳。\n（见方回《瀛奎髓》卷四十八《仙逸类》。\n）（按《瀛奎律髓》原注云：「九龄，乾德五年进士第三人。\n」与《全唐诗》小传作乾德二年者异。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}